<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40934" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπεύδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>urge on, further</i> or <i>promote</i> an object,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσπεύδω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ δρᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					467
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν στρατείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.138
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of persons, <i>urge on, hasten</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδίταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.93
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς</span> (attracted
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὓς</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μὴ
				φύσις ἐπέσπευσεν</span> whom Nature <i>has</i> not
				<i>matured quickly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				810b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. intr.,
				<i>hasten onward</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1275
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰς ταὐτόν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					7.4
				</span></i>
			: part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπεύδων</span>
			<i>in haste</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1389
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -σπεῦδον τῆς πορείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					8.17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
